    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Covert Ops Cell</strong></p><p><strong>“If you saw it happen, it wasn’t us.”</strong></p><p>Covert Ops cells make wars quiet. They prefer locks to speeches, shadows to banners, and results to credit. They don’t start fights—they rearrange the board so the fight never happens.</p><p><em>You’ve stopped improvising and started operating.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> When undertaking an Infiltration scenario, the Alarm Level threshold is increased, allowing for more failures before a full alert is triggered.</li></ul>",
